NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000930 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000931 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000932 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000933 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000934 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000935 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000936 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000937 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000938 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000939 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000940 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000941 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000942 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000943 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000944 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000945 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000946 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000947 ""
